Patches applied to the pristine hdparm-9.65 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

  0001-likeos-platform-headers.patch
        The kernel interface (types, BLK*, HDIO_*, SG_IO) comes from the
        LikeOS C library headers and the port's likeos-hdparm.h; MAP_LOCKED
        is 0 (memory is never paged out).

  0002-fallocate-through-libc.patch
        --fallocate calls the C library's fallocate().

  0003-dvdspeed-set-streaming-via-sg-io.patch
        -E sends the SET STREAMING packet to an optical drive through SG_IO.

